      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPRING VICTORIA (1) goes very well this trip starting 15 times for five wins and three minors. Was out of placings last time (35.18) at this track in a Grade 4/5, finishing fifth and beaten 11 lengths. Appeals as a leading chance in this. ERASE AND REWIND (5) rocketed out of the boxes with a strong early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when second (25.33) at Shepparton over 450m. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Hard to beat again. PERFECT PICTURE (2) drew this same box last time when in the minors (34.73) in a Grade 5 over 595m at this track. Should be in this for a long way. PURE PRECISION (8) hit the frame latest (29.92) when third at this track in a Grade 5 FIN. Has already won three times from this draw.",
